 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421779 1083 #uuid "d7fec48c-2c4b-5a3b-8559-e99202ca21e4" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421767 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421768 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421773 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421774 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421775 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1077 "selection" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1078 #edb/ref 17592186421768 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421780 1079 #uuid "44498254-f6d6-5947-a33a-02e052e8e1fb" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421765 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421766 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421772 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421778 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421779 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1077 "selection" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1078 #edb/ref 17592186421765 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421781 1079 #uuid "b8009739-528a-5b9d-8b7a-977eb7894c6b" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421769 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421770 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421771 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421776 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1075 #edb/ref 17592186421777 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1077 "selection" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1078 #edb/ref 17592186421770 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421782 1079 #uuid "de26f158-7713-5413-99c7-ec6ea96881bb" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421783 1068 #edb/ref 17592186421780 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421783 1069 "q-161304" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421783 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421783 1071 "Consider the vector field $F$ and the surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v),$ where\n\n$$\nF(x,y,z)=⟨{x}^{2},\\,xy,\\,z⟩,\\,r(u,v)=⟨u,\\,v,\\,2uv⟩,\\,(u,v)\\in D⊂{R}^{2}.\n$$\n\nIf the flux of $F$ across $S$ with respect to $n$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{D}auv+b{u}^{2}v\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $a+b?$" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421783 1072 #uuid "27b29e44-b12e-5311-b5aa-28b3cb92f7e4" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421783 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}2uv)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,0,\\,2v⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2uv)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,2u⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2v \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2u\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2v \\\\ 1 & 2u\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2v \\\\ 0 & 2u\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2v,\\,-2u,\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v)) & =⟨{x}^{2},\\,xy,\\,z⟩{|}_{x=u\\,y=v\\,z=2uv} \\\\  & =⟨{u}^{2},\\,uv,\\,2uv⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the dot product of $F$ and ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}) & =⟨{u}^{2},\\,uv,\\,2uv⟩\\cdot ⟨-2v,\\,-2u,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & ={u}^{2}\\cdot (-2v)+uv\\cdot (-2u)+2uv\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-2{u}^{2}v-2{u}^{2}v+2uv \\\\  & =2uv-4{u}^{2}v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}2\\cdot uv+(-4)\\cdot {u}^{2}v\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, \n\n$$\na+b=2-4=-2.\n$$" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421784 1068 #edb/ref 17592186421782 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421784 1069 "q-161258" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421784 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421784 1071 "Evaluate the surface integral\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}⟨3x,\\,-{y}^{2},\\,2⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S\n$$\n\nwhere the parametric surface $S$ is defined by\n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨3uv,\\,u,\\,-v⟩\n$$\n\nover the domain $D={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1}.$\n\n*Hint: You can use the fact that ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}=⟨-1,\\,3v,\\,-3u⟩.$*" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421784 1072 #uuid "4c963e37-fb2b-5cec-bc6e-5cbde0fb10aa" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421784 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe're given that the fundamental vector product for our surface is\n\n$$\n{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}=⟨-1,\\,3v,\\,-3u⟩.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v)) & ={⟨3x,\\,-{y}^{2},\\,2⟩|}_{x=3uv\\,y=u\\,z=-v} \\\\  & =⟨3(3uv),\\,-{u}^{2},\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨9uv,\\,-{u}^{2},\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we calculate the dot product of $F$ and ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}) & =⟨9uv,\\,-{u}^{2},\\,2⟩\\cdot ⟨-1,\\,3v,\\,-3u⟩ \\\\  & =9uv\\cdot (-1)+(-{u}^{2})\\cdot 3v+2\\cdot (-3u) \\\\  & =-9uv-3{u}^{2}v-6u\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral evaluates to\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}⟨3x,\\,-{y}^{2},\\,2⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-9uv-3{u}^{2}v-6u)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(-9uv-3{u}^{2}v-6u)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[-\\frac{9}{2}{u}^{2}v-{u}^{3}v-3{u}^{2}]}_{u=0}^{u=1}\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(-\\frac{11}{2}v-3)\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={[-\\frac{11}{4}{v}^{2}-3v]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{11}{4}-3 \\\\  & =-\\frac{23}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421785 1068 #edb/ref 17592186421781 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421785 1069 "q-162593" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421785 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421785 1071 "Evaluate the surface integral\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}⟨3z,\\,-2x,\\,-y⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S\n$$\n\nwhere the parametric surface $S$ is defined by the equations\n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨-v,\\,-u,\\,{u}^{2}⟩\n$$\n\nfor $0\\le u\\le 1$ and $0\\le v\\le 1.$" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421785 1072 #uuid "f3288098-3c26-556d-b6c9-f206da47adfb" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true] [17592186421785 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(-v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(-u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}({u}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,-1,\\,2u⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(-v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(-u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}({u}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,0,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & -1 & 2u \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2u \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|,-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2u \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}|,|\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,-2u,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v)) & ={⟨3z,\\,-2x,\\,-y⟩|}_{x=-v\\,y=-u\\,z={u}^{2}} \\\\  & =⟨3{u}^{2},\\,-2(-v),\\,-(-u)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3{u}^{2},\\,2v,\\,u⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we calculate the dot product of $F$ and ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}) & =⟨3{u}^{2},\\,2v,\\,u⟩\\cdot ⟨0,\\,-2u,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =3{u}^{2}\\cdot 0+2v\\cdot (-2u)+u\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-4uv-u\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral evaluates to\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}⟨3z,\\,-2x,\\,-y⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-4uv-u)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(-4uv-u)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(4uv+u)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{0}^{1}{[2{u}^{2}v+\\frac{1}{2}{u}^{2}]}_{u=0}^{u=1}\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{0}^{1}(2v+\\frac{1}{2})\\text{d}v \\\\  & =-{[{v}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}v]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534442 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-127c5717-261e-5aef-838e-be5fab62b6d9" 17592186421765 "answer-176992fe-e63a-5f75-8661-ee649edc6971" 17592186421766 "answer-189bee50-4a99-5b40-af14-d79a6be4cf78" 17592186421767 "answer-1ab31c93-1b65-5e8b-a761-9f8a56bd7091" 17592186421768 "answer-3a219dca-1e12-574f-9fc3-d709a89775ad" 17592186421769 "answer-4b502ee2-042d-5a3e-86ae-ba6ad14e00b2" 17592186421770 "answer-5be10e6b-2fc0-5157-8d4c-a6365644fb4a" 17592186421771 "answer-794b5eb2-d0f5-57bd-8363-4337b7e59452" 17592186421772 "answer-936a7baa-180a-5ac4-87b7-254a0a451cae" 17592186421773 "answer-9c1d5f42-e69e-5804-8ffc-1ba7c0a90d40" 17592186421774 "answer-a21a5496-3418-514f-ae65-4dd4f8f20907" 17592186421775 "answer-ac272ec2-a123-566b-9ae4-94a591001c16" 17592186421776 "answer-bb4a967e-d128-5262-a38b-86976eb912e7" 17592186421777 "answer-cb9f4e2e-e860-55d7-8d5c-c33be0190db3" 17592186421778 "answer-d7fec48c-2c4b-5a3b-8559-e99202ca21e4" 17592186421779 "answer-field-44498254-f6d6-5947-a33a-02e052e8e1fb" 17592186421780 "answer-field-b8009739-528a-5b9d-8b7a-977eb7894c6b" 17592186421781 "answer-field-de26f158-7713-5413-99c7-ec6ea96881bb" 17592186421782 "question-27b29e44-b12e-5311-b5aa-28b3cb92f7e4" 17592186421783 "question-4c963e37-fb2b-5cec-bc6e-5cbde0fb10aa" 17592186421784 "question-f3288098-3c26-556d-b6c9-f206da47adfb" 17592186421785} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
